($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 4691048, $f$21 Days Prompt Fic$f$, ARRAY[$f$macabre_monkey$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Valdemar Series - Mercedes Lackey$f$, $f$The Last Herald Mage$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Written for the prompt, Vanyel has all the mage-power in the world. Instead of a dramatic duel, why not use that power to drop an avalanche on Leareth? Or some other indirect attack? Fix-it AU or explanation why Vanyel didn't think of a non-suicidal alternative in fic format.$f$, 7120, 3, 3, true, 5, false, $f$2017-10-16T03:36:30.741+00:00$f$, NULL, $f$2015-08-30T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
