($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 5454257, $f$“Close in Friendship”: Homosocial Relationships in the First Age$f$, ARRAY[$f$Cinaed$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Silmarillion and other histories of Middle-Earth - J. R. R. Tolkien$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$The collection gathers diaries, essays, and letters that span over a four thousand year period, beginning with Faramir of Ithilien’s private musings on the relationship between Maedhros and Fingon, and ending with a modern essay concerning a cache of letters recently discovered in the Gondorian Archives that sheds further light on several homosocial relationships, particularly amongst the Haladin.$f$, 1505, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2019-07-29T11:31:23.532+00:00$f$, $f$2019-07-29T11:31:23.591+00:00$f$, $f$2015-12-18T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 5466353, $f$Two Men, Crossing the Street$f$, ARRAY[$f$merle_p$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$The Man From U.N.C.L.E. (2015)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$“They are useless to their countries,” he says slowly. “Everyone knows their real names, their faces. A spy who cannot spy. Is like – like a car that cannot drive. Useless.”“Ah,” Napoleon says quietly, as if he finally understands what Illya is so angry about. But he doesn’t, Illya thinks, he can’t know, not really, and he isn’t sure if it’s sadness or relief he feels at the thought.$f$, 8221, 1, 1, true, 5, false, $f$2017-10-16T03:36:58.948+00:00$f$, NULL, $f$2015-12-31T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
