($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 6388891, $f$Decisions, Decisions$f$, ARRAY[$f$yaoi_yaoieverywhere$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 | JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken | JoJo's Bizarre Adventure$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$All Josuke wanted to do was pull an itty bitty prank on Rohan to get some attention. Really! It's not like he planned on, y'know, being stuck in a literal closet waiting for Rohan to leave.
...Rohan's not leaving. He's pulling something out of his bedside table. Is that-?$f$, 2510, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2018-06-21T10:40:58.653+00:00$f$, $f$2018-06-21T10:40:59.293+00:00$f$, $f$2016-03-28T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 6399652, $f$Anything You Can Do$f$, ARRAY[$f$yaoi_yaoieverywhere$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 | JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken | JoJo's Bizarre Adventure$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Rohan gets offered a generous sum of money to teach a few art classes at the local highschool. If it weren't for the money he'd have turned it down, but as it was he still needed money for furniture after his last house got burned down. Josuke happens to be in one of the classes he's got to teach. Rohan wants revenge even though they've been together for a while. Shameless PWP$f$, 2367, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2018-08-07T23:52:42.011+00:00$f$, $f$2018-08-07T23:52:42.312+00:00$f$, $f$2016-04-09T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 6489850, $f$Liar$f$, ARRAY[$f$TimeToRemember$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Gentleman Bastard Sequence - Scott Lynch$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Everything is working perfectly for Locke and Sabetha, two somewhat unlikely proprietors of the most unprofitable antiques shop in the city. After many months of work, their careful plans are reaching eventual fruition, the result of which will surely make up for such a prolonged period of difficult activity.
Enter Jean Tannen.
Now Locke is having feelings he has no hope of explaining, Jean is confused and also a little worried, and Sabetha just wants to know what she ever did to end up babysitting these two oblivious idiots.

  Updated 11 August 2016 in anticipation of a second chapter.$f$, 2254, 1, 2, false, -1, false, $f$2018-12-28T20:53:06.558+00:00$f$, $f$2018-12-28T20:53:06.618+00:00$f$, $f$2016-04-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 6496153, $f$you're stronger than all of them.$f$, ARRAY[$f$dixonbelcourts$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$Dishonored (Video Game)$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], NULL, NULL, 1, 1, true, -1, false, $f$2017-11-12T01:23:39.646+00:00$f$, $f$2017-11-12T01:23:39.745+00:00$f$, $f$2016-04-08T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
($f$080b7013-14b2-4fd8-be8b-f567db3cdb39$f$, 6508552, $f$Try It?$f$, ARRAY[$f$yaoi_yaoieverywhere$f$]::text[], ARRAY[$f$ジョジョの奇妙な冒険 | JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken | JoJo's Bizarre Adventure$f$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[]::text[], $f$Honestly it's understandable that Josuke would be at least a little afraid of actually being on the bottom when it comes to sex. He's young and the only way he's gotten that type of pleasure before was from his dick. It's hard to process that getting anything shoved up your ass could feel good without having prior experience.That's doesn't mean Rohan is going to be the bottom all the time. All he has to do is reassure Josuke that there's a different kind of pleasure from receiving instead of giving. Somehow.$f$, 3006, 1, 1, true, 3, false, $f$2018-08-08T03:55:51.908+00:00$f$, $f$2018-08-08T03:55:51.992+00:00$f$, $f$2016-04-12T00:00:00.000+00:00$f$, false, false, true, NULL, NULL, ARRAY[]::text[]),
